WEBVTT

00:17:57.396 --> 00:18:01.796
So it's really important to see
the ways that, you know,

00:18:01.796 --> 00:18:03.796
just like some of the suggestions I made,

00:18:03.796 --> 00:18:06.436
ways that you can practice
getting better at this,

00:18:06.436 --> 00:18:08.316
because it really pays off.

00:18:08.316 --> 00:18:11.716
But some people are not so good at this.

00:18:11.756 --> 00:18:14.076
And they can have perfectly wonderful,

00:18:14.076 --> 00:18:15.836
happy, healthy lives

00:18:15.836 --> 00:18:18.996
without being social
butterflies and extroverts.

00:18:19.036 --> 00:18:20.396
And I just want to name that

00:18:20.396 --> 00:18:22.436
so that people don't go away thinking,

00:18:22.476 --> 00:18:25.916
"Gosh, if I'm not an extrovert,
I'm out of luck."

00:18:25.956 --> 00:18:27.516
Not true at all.

00:18:27.516 --> 00:18:31.916
Many of our happiest people
had quieter lives.